  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 88 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}又是那家伙啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_820.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这次可不简单。\n似乎需要{F2 01 03 01}故意被蜘蛛网缠住{F2 01 01 01}，\n巧妙地引导它。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_820.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}从被蜘蛛网缠住到能挣脱……\n我记得，是蜘蛛跳３次的时间吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_820.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这种蜘蛛\n只会在蜘蛛网上移动。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_820.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F2 01 03 01}计算好它移动３次{F2 01 01 01}后的距离，\n再把它引过来就行了，对吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
